          %h4#ReferencesTypeIIStringsOnADE Type II-string theory on ADE-orbifolds
          %p
            The observation that the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/worldsheet"} worldsheet
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2d+CFT"} 2d CFT
            correspoding to a string probing (a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D-brane"} D-brane
